  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man (James McAvoy) as 'the squad'. The text 'when you don't need a squad be you are the squad' uses 'you' to directly address the viewer, prompting them to identify with the man's self-reliant and confident demeanor. The user is thus projected onto the man as the embodiment of self-sufficiency and personal empowerment.",
